                            <comment id="494797" author="JIRAUSER22000" created="Wed, 20 May 2026 12:06:48 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;Comes from &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/GCP-250&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/GCP-250&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;div class=&quot;code panel&quot; style=&quot;border-width: 1px;&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;codeContent panelContent&quot;&gt;
&lt;pre class=&quot;code-c&quot;&gt;
Author: Jinshan Xiong &lt;span class=&quot;code-quote-red&quot;&gt;&amp;lt;jinshanx@google.com&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;
Date:   Thu May 14 20:04:12 2026 +0000

    Identify the mmap use &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;case&lt;/span&gt; properly

    Change-Id: Iffd069b67a4b28e630b834886ff1679c501c2b74

diff --git a/lustre/llite/rw.c b/lustre/llite/rw.c
index f6836627fe..753c9613e9 100644
--- a/lustre/llite/rw.c
+++ b/lustre/llite/rw.c
@@ -1742,8 +1742,7 @@ &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; ll_io_read_page(&lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;struct&lt;/span&gt; lu_env *env, &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;struct&lt;/span&gt; cl_io *io,
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;struct&lt;/span&gt; cl_sync_io         *anchor = &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;NULL&lt;/span&gt;;
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;int&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;                        rc = 0, rc2 = 0;
        &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;bool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;                       uptodate;
-       &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;struct&lt;/span&gt; vvp_io *vio = vvp_env_io(env);
-       &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;bool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; mmap = !vio-&amp;gt;vui_ra_valid;
+       &lt;span class=&quot;code-keyword&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;code-object&quot;&gt;bool&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt; mmap = !!(io-&amp;gt;ci_type == CIT_FAULT);
        pgoff_t ra_start_index = 0;
        pgoff_t io_start_index;
        pgoff_t io_end_index;

&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="494802" author="gerrit" created="Wed, 20 May 2026 13:39:57 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;&quot;Xiyang Wang &amp;lt;xiwang@ddn.com&amp;gt;&quot; uploaded a new patch: &lt;a href=&quot;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/66029&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/66029&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
